`doc/man_docs.go` belongs to package `doc` (line 15) and implements man-page generation for Cobra commands.

- `GenMan` generates a command’s man page and writes the rendered result to an `io.Writer` using `md2man.Render` (lines 103–116).
- `fillHeader` supplies defaults: uppercase escaped command title, section `"1"`, current date or `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`, formatted month/year, and `"Auto generated by spf13/cobra"` unless auto-generation tags are disabled (lines 118–141).
- Tree generation is exposed through `GenManTree` and `GenManTreeFromOpts` (lines 38–49), configured by `GenManTreeOptions` with `Header`, `Path`, and `CommandSeparator` (lines 82–88).
- Internal helpers include `manPreamble`, `manPrintFlags`, and `genMan`; `genMan` initializes the default help command and flag (lines 143–144, 159–160, 202–204).
